    "text": "wkzo.com\nwebsite\nKalamazoo\nAUDIO: Kalamazoo Public Safety looking for July 4th weekend shooting suspects\nBy John McNeill,1 days ago\nKALAMAZOO, MI (WKZO AM/FM) – That popping sound you heard on the 4th of July in Kalamazoo may have been more than firecrackers. Public Safety Chief Dave Boysen says they are still investigating four shooting incidents in Kalamazoo Friday night and Saturday morning that sent 8 people to area emergency rooms. One died, one is critical and the other six should recover.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
